### end token followed by a space and Windows line endings
cat <<DONE 
building
DONE
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>> SC1017 1:12
>>- SC1041 1:7 -- mvdan treats CRLF as a line ending, so the end token matches and only SC1017 applies
>>- SC1042 1:7 -- mvdan treats CRLF as a line ending, so the end token matches and only SC1017 applies
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5

### end token with a suffix on its line
cat <<EOF
results below
EOF2
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1041 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message quotes the line holding the end token
>>- SC1042 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message quotes the line holding the end token
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5

### end token in the middle of a body line
mail -s report admin <<END
see the END of the log
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1041 1:24 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message quotes the line holding the end token
>>- SC1042 1:24 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message quotes the line holding the end token
>>> SC1072 3:1
>>> SC1073 1:22

### terminator line present
cat <<EOF
results below
EOF
>>> none

### indentation already reported
cat <<EOF
results below
  EOF
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1039 3:1 -- the here-document is never closed, a parser syntax error whose message names the indented end token
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5
